  <!-- Device markers (ADR-0005), one per entry in devices.yaml. Written as
       Sweet Home 3D writes them: catalogId from the SmartHome marker
       library, kind and placementKey as <property> children.

       At phase 1 these mirror devices.yaml, which is still the operative
       file — the converter emits them into house.yaml where nothing reads
       them yet, so the two must agree and the golden test proves they do.
       At phase 2 the direction reverses: these markers become the source
       of truth and devices.yaml shrinks to bindings.yaml. -->
  <pieceOfFurniture id="pf-garage-door" catalogId="SmartHome#garage-door" name="Garage Door" creator="SmartHome" level="level0" x="300" y="760" width="10" depth="10" height="10">
